{"id":"6e0988554a7f9a4b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-exact-rosser-system.md","title":"Exact Rosser System for Sets","display":"df-exact-rosser-system — Exact Rosser System for Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-exact-rosser-system","aliases":["92-df-exact-rosser-system"],"display":"df-exact-rosser-system — Exact Rosser System for Sets","source":"第 VII 章 pp. 90–91（PDF 107–108）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-exact-rosser-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-exact-rosser-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exact-rosser-system — Exact Rosser System for Sets"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 pp. 90–91（PDF 107–108）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"905868da4e6087cf\" href=\"?note=905868da4e6087cf\" title=\"92-df-separation-in-system\">92-df-separation-in-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 为 c.e. 谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 为精确分离关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G\\)</span> 为下文定义的系统性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\land A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\land A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确分离对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cup B\">\\(A\\cup B\\)</span> 外的每个输入产生未判定句，而普通 Rosser 分离不要求这一点。取两个空集合便要求存在正负实例都不可证的公式；在经典爆炸演算下因此排除不一致系统。不要把“存在一个未判定实例”自动解释为所有集合都可精确分离。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 pp. 90–91（PDF 107–108）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-separation-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"905868da4e6087cf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExactRosser}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\land A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\\\\n&\\Longrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A\\cup B","display":false}],"bytes":1543,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-shepherdson-exact-separation]] → [[92-thm-shepherdson-exact-separation]] → [[92-df-exact-rosser-system]]。普通相容性下的精确表示由该机制获得；不能把任意语义上定义同一个 c.e. 集的 $\\Sigma_1$ 公式替代进去。"},{"id":"faf6841087a5303b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-exact-rosser-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-exact-rosser-system]]"}],"outgoing":["905868da4e6087cf","69a2a133da01f9c9","62f011418ee9c44e"]}